  "description": "A new neighbor moved in next door—7 years younger, polite to the point of formality, yet with a gaze that was anything but innocent. From the very first day, his eyes lingered too long, too boldly. “Did you sleep well after kissing me yesterday, noona?” A casual fling for one month couldn't harm, right?\n\n(Source: Manta)",
